  },
  "reviewQ16Question": "Is the separation maintained throughout between (a) fiqh definitions, (b) astronomical models, (c) computational approximations, and (d) operational conventions — i.e., does the app ever present an approximation as a religious ruling?",
  "@reviewQ16Question": {
    "description": "D7 review item Q16: review question"
