  "reviewQ17Question": "Are the named alternatives (Egyptian 19.5/17.5, UOIF 12/12, Moonsighting 18/18, midnight-Isha, extended-Maghrib, custom angles) presented with sufficient labeling that no user could mistake one for the reviewed default?",
  "@reviewQ17Question": {
