  },
  "reviewP8Question": "Obtain the printed text of the verses of al-'Allama Muhammad Mawlud's al-Kafaf quoted in Sheikh Muhammad Mahmud al-Shinqiti's Risala commentary (the Baheth transcription is garbled at that point).",
  "@reviewP8Question": {
    "description": "D7 review item P8: review question"
